            Welcome to the Privacy Policy page of Iconic Hotel Naran. This document outlines the principles and practices we adhere to regarding the collection, use, and protection of your personal information when you visit our website or engage with our services. By using our website or services, you agree to the terms outlined in this Privacy Policy.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            We are committed to being transparent about the data we collect. The types of information we gather include:
        </p>


        <ul>
            <li><b>Personal Information:</b> This may include your name, contact details, email address, and other relevant details necessary for your bookings and interactions with us.</li>
            <li><b>Browsing Information:</b> We may collect data related to your visit, such as your IP address, browser type, and pages visited. This information helps us enhance your overall online experience.</li>

        </ul>

        <h3>
            2. How We Use Your Information
        </h3>

        <p>Your information serves various purposes, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Personalization:</b> We use your data to tailor your experience, providing you with relevant content and services based on your preferences.</li>
            <li><b>Transaction Processing:</b> Any information you provide during the booking process is used to facilitate and complete your transactions with us.</li>
            <li><b>Communication:</b> We may use your contact details to communicate with you about your bookings, respond to inquiries, and keep you informed about our services.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>
            3. Security Measures
        </h3>
        <p>
            Ensuring the security of your personal information is a top priority. Our security measures include:
        </p>
            •	SSL Encryption: Our website employs secure socket layer (SSL) technology to encrypt data during transmission, safeguarding it against unauthorized access.
            •	Regular Updates: We continuously update our security protocols to stay ahead of potential threats and vulnerabilities.
            <h3>
                4. Third-Party Disclosure
            </h3>
            <p>
                We respect your privacy. Your personally identifiable information is not sold, traded, or transferred to third parties without your explicit consent. Exceptions are made for trusted third parties who assist us in our operations and agree to uphold confidentiality.
            </p>
            <h3>
                5. Cookies and Tracking
            </h3>
            <p>
                Our use of cookies and tracking technologies enhances your online experience.
            </p>
            <p>
                Opt-Out Options: You have the option to accept or decline cookies through your browser settings. However, note that declining cookies may impact certain functionalities.
            </p>
            <h3>
                6. Your Consent
            </h3>
            <p>
                By using our website, you provide your consent to the practices outlined in this Privacy Policy. If you disagree with any aspect, please refrain from using our services.
            </p>
            <h3>
